open Red Team/Kerberoasting.md
scenario answer
send Summarize this note
settle
newconv
scenario action
send Second conversation
settle
newconv
history
wait 300
shot ai-history-list
resume 1
wait 600
shot ai-resume
menu models
wait 400
shot ai-models-fetched
menu none
newconv

focus
type @a
wait 300
key down
key down
wait 200
shot ai-mention-keys
key escape
newconv

scenario tools
send Which notes talk about this technique?
settle
wait 300
shot ai-links
newconv

scenario long
send A long answer please
settle
wait 400
shot ai-long-end
newconv

lang ar
width 240
